# Butler Routes - Loch Modan completionist pilot (pack butler-routes-completionist, v0.6.0).
# Every Loch Modan quest in the local census (41 quests, docs/loch-modan-census.md)
# appears exactly once as an accept and once as a turnin.
# Entry: the Dun Morogh route turns in 1339 to Mountaineer Stormpike at the tunnel;
# this route opens there and establishes Thelsamar first. Chain order is strictly
# turn-in-before-accept (external pres become notes + listed structural warnings);
# item-started quests never wedge (note at the source, sourcing optional);
# the Mo'grosh ogres and Ol' Sooty are elites, noted as group content.
# Coordinates on Loch Modan use the era frame; Wetlands, Ironforge and Westfall
# stops use the frames their data carries, set with zone map lines.
guide butler-routes-completionist/loch-modan
title Loch Modan - Completionist
levels 10-20
zone Loch Modan
faction Alliance
category Leveling
folder Completionist
keywords loch modan, completionist, thelsamar, ironband, farstrider, algaz
coords live
version 1

step Stormpike's camp - entry

  zone map 1432

  tip Over the tunnel from Dun Morogh: Mountaineer Stormpike (24.8, 18.4) holds the camp. The Dun Morogh route turned in 1339 here, so Stormpike's Order (1338) is open.
  accept 1338 -- Stormpike's Order - Mountaineer Stormpike; carry his request to Furen Longbeard in Stormwind, late
  accept 307 -- Filthy Paws - Mountaineer Stormpike; Miners' Gear from the Silver Stream Mine, north-west

step Thelsamar - the hub

  tip Thelsamar, the Alliance hub of the Loch. Innkeeper Hearthstove (35.5, 48.4) binds your home; Thorgrum Borrelson (33.9, 51.0) runs the gryphon roost; Morhan Coppertongue (34.0, 46.5) is the metalsmith; Brock Stoneseeker (37.0, 47.8) teaches Mining. Take every quest in town before you head out.
  accept 255 -- Mercenaries - Magistrate Bluntnose; Mo'grosh Ogres, Brutes and Enforcers - all elites, bring help
  note WANTED: Chok'sul (256) starts from the poster on the Thelsamar board (37.3, 46.5). Chok'sul is a level-22 Mo'grosh elite (79.6, 14.7) - group content, not a solo detour.
  accept 256 -- WANTED: Chok'sul - the poster; Chok'sul's Head from the Mo'grosh stronghold, north-east
  accept 418 -- Thelsamar Blood Sausages - Vidra Hearthstove; Boar Intestines, Bear Meat and Spider Ichor
  accept 6387 only Dwarf,Gnome -- Honor Students - Brock Stoneseeker; carry his list to Thorgrum Borrelson, here in town
  note Snowbound (86667) starts with Grenhild Darktalon; the data lists no source for the Jar of Snow, so check Grenhild's dialog and your bags.
  accept 86667 -- Snowbound - Grenhild Darktalon; a Jar of Snow for Norric Lochthane on the north-west coast
  accept 436 -- Ironband's Excavation - Jern Hornhelm; speak with Explorer Fellhew at the dig, south-east

step Thelsamar - the metalsmith's errand
  when skill Mining 1

  note Miners only. Morhan Coppertongue wants ten Bronze Bars for Ingredients for the Forge (86776); no vendor sells them, so smelt or buy the bars before you turn in. Non-miners skip this step cleanly.
  accept 86776 -- Ingredients for the Forge - Morhan Coppertongue; ten Bronze Bars
  turnin 86776 -- Ingredients for the Forge - the bars to Morhan Coppertongue

step Silver Stream Mine and the north-west

  tip The mine sits north-west of town: Miners' League Crates, Tunnel Rats, Mountain Boars. Norric Lochthane (41.8, 19.1) keeps his house on the coast road.
  complete 307 @34.8,26.7 era -- four loads of Miners' Gear from the crates in the mine
  complete 418 @24.3,21.4 era -- three Boar Intestines off the Mountain Boars by the mine
  accept 94495 only Shaman -- Call of Water - Norric Lochthane; find Hervdana Saegrund in the Wetlands. Needs 94494 (Eldrun Stormbreaker, Ironforge) first - take it during the Ironforge trip.
  accept 94502 only Shaman -- Call of Water - Norric Lochthane; cleanse at Stendel's Pond in Westfall, late. Needs 94501 (Hervdana, Wetlands) first.
  turnin 86667 -- Snowbound - the Jar of Snow to Norric Lochthane

step The southern guard tower - Defense of the King's Lands

  tip The southern guard tower (22-24, 73-76): Cobbleflint, Wallbang, Gravelgaw and Captain Rugelfuss. Work the chain in order - each leg opens the next - then sweep south for the Skullthumpers, Shamans and Grawmug's crew.
  accept 224 -- In Defense of the King's Lands - Mountaineer Cobbleflint; Stonesplinter Troggs and Scouts
  accept 267 -- The Trogg Threat - Captain Rugelfuss; eight Trogg Stone Teeth
  complete 224 @26.1,51.8 era -- ten Stonesplinter Troggs and ten Stonesplinter Scouts
  complete 267 @26.1,51.8 era -- eight Trogg Stone Teeth off the Stonesplinters
  complete 418 @18.9,75.5 era -- three Bear Meat off the Elder Black Bears, south-west
  complete 418 @48.7,72.4 era -- three Spider Ichor off the Cliff Lurkers, south
  turnin 224 -- In Defense of the King's Lands - back to Mountaineer Cobbleflint
  turnin 267 -- The Trogg Threat - the teeth to Captain Rugelfuss
  accept 237 -- In Defense of the King's Lands - Mountaineer Gravelgaw; Skullthumpers and Seers, south
  note Shamans: the Stonesplinter Seers carry Reagent Pouches - hold one for Braldir Ashmantle's later errand (94466).
  accept 86585 -- Banner of the Fallen - Mountaineer Ylva, far south (31.8, 86.3); call out the Headsplitter and kill it
  complete 237 @27.9,83.4 era -- ten Stonesplinter Skullthumpers and ten Stonesplinter Seers
  complete 86585 @29.5,81.4 era -- the Headsplitter, south of Ylva's stand
  turnin 237 -- In Defense of the King's Lands - back to Mountaineer Gravelgaw
  accept 263 -- In Defense of the King's Lands - Mountaineer Wallbang; Shamans and Bonesnappers, far south
  complete 263 @33.8,93.9 era -- ten Stonesplinter Shaman and ten Stonesplinter Bonesnappers
  turnin 263 -- In Defense of the King's Lands - back to Mountaineer Wallbang
  accept 217 -- In Defense of the King's Lands - Captain Rugelfuss; Grawmug and his guards
  complete 217 @34.8,90.5 era -- Grawmug, Gnasher and Brawler
  turnin 217 -- In Defense of the King's Lands - back to Captain Rugelfuss
  turnin 86585 -- Banner of the Fallen - the Headsplitter's end to Captain Rugelfuss
  turnin 307 -- Filthy Paws - the Miners' Gear to Mountaineer Stormpike

step Stonewrought Dam - a Dark Threat looms

  tip Chief Engineer Hinderweir VII (46.1, 13.6) minds the dam. Work his chain in order: the Suspicious Barrel (56.1, 13.2) points back at him, and his powder heads for the Wetlands late.
  accept 250 -- A Dark Threat Looms - Chief Engineer Hinderweir; investigate the eastern ramp of the dam
  turnin 250 -- A Dark Threat Looms - the clue to Hinderweir, at the Suspicious Barrel
  accept 199 -- A Dark Threat Looms - the barrel; show Hinderweir what you found
  turnin 199 -- A Dark Threat Looms - back to Chief Engineer Hinderweir
  accept 161 -- A Dark Threat Looms - Hinderweir; his strange powder goes to Ashlan Stonesmirk in the Wetlands, late
  note A Dark Threat Looms (278) starts here too but needs 274 (Ashlan, Wetlands) first - take it now and gather later.
  accept 278 -- A Dark Threat Looms - Chief Engineer Hinderweir; Lurker Venom, a Mo'grosh Crystal and a Crocolisk Tear

step Braldir's errand - shaman's gathering
  only Shaman

  tip Braldir Ashmantle (32.2, 66.0) carries the Call of Fire on from Dun Morogh. His errand needs a Reagent Pouch (Stonesplinter Seers, south) and Fire Tar (Tunnel Rat Geomancers, Silver Stream Mine) - gather both, then the Minor Manifestation of Fire burns by the shrine.
  accept 94466 -- Call of Fire - Braldir Ashmantle; a Fire Tar and a Reagent Pouch
step Seers and geomancers - Braldir's reagents
  when onquest 94466

  complete 94466 @27.9,83.4 era -- a Reagent Pouch off the Stonesplinter Seers, south
  complete 94466 @35.5,22.6 era -- Fire Tar off the Tunnel Rat Geomancers in the mine

  turnin 94466 -- Call of Fire - the tar and pouch to Braldir Ashmantle
  accept 94467 -- Call of Fire - Braldir Ashmantle; a Glowing Ember for the shrine
step The Shrine of Eternal Flame
  when onquest 94467

  complete 94467 @32.0,64.4 era -- the Minor Manifestation of Fire, by the Shrine of Eternal Flame

  turnin 94467 -- Call of Fire - the Glowing Ember in the Brazier of the Dormant Flame

step Ironband's Excavation - the dig

  tip The dig sits south-east: Ironband (65.9, 65.6), Fellhew (64.9, 66.7), Miran and Huldar (52.2, 69.3-4), Bingles Blastenheimer (63.6, 47.9). Pick up Excavation Tools where they lie - they start their own errand.
  turnin 436 -- Ironband's Excavation - Hornhelm's word to Explorer Fellhew
  accept 297 -- Gathering Idols - Magmar Fellhew; eight Carved Stone Idols
  complete 297 @68.0,63.0 era -- eight Carved Stone Idols off the Geomancers, Diggers and Berserk Troggs
  turnin 297 -- Gathering Idols - the idols to Magmar Fellhew
  accept 298 -- Excavation Progress Report - Prospector Ironband; carry his report to Jern Hornhelm in Thelsamar
  note Excavation Tools (86613): pick up the tools at the dig (66-72, 59-68) and use them - six more for Fellhew's crew. The tools say Fellhew; the data sends them to Ironband, so hand them to Ironband.
  accept 86613 -- Excavation Tools - use the Excavation Tools
  complete 86613 @69.0,64.0 era -- six more Excavation Tools around the dig
  turnin 86613 -- Excavation Tools - the tools to Prospector Ironband

step Thelsamar - reports and the Ironforge road

  tip Hornhelm takes the dig's report; Vidra takes her sausages. Then the road runs to Ironforge: Stormpike wants 301, and three noted errands gate later turnins - take them all while in the city.
  turnin 298 -- Excavation Progress Report - Ironband's report to Jern Hornhelm
  accept 301 -- Report to Ironforge - Jern Hornhelm; Ironband's report goes to Prospector Stormpike in Ironforge
  turnin 418 -- Thelsamar Blood Sausages - the fixings to Vidra Hearthstove

step Ironforge - the city's business

  zone map 1455

  tip One Ironforge trip closes the zone's city business. Three noted errands gate Loch turnins - Powder to Ironband (302, Stormpike to Hornhelm) for 273, Find Bingles (2039, Gnoarn to Bingles) for 2038, and Call of Water (94494, Eldrun Stormbreaker to Norric) for Shamans' 94495.
  turnin 301 -- Report to Ironforge - the report to Prospector Stormpike
  note Powder to Ironband (302): take it from Prospector Stormpike and speak with Jern Hornhelm back in Thelsamar - Resupplying the Excavation (273) needs it first.
  note Find Bingles (2039): Gnoarn in Ironforge sends you to Bingles Blastenheimer at the dig - his Missing Supplies (2038) need it first.
  note Shamans: Eldrun Stormbreaker sends Call of Water (94494) to Norric Lochthane - 94495 needs it first.

step Thelsamar muster and the dig again

  zone map 1432

  tip With Ironforge's errands done, the dig chain runs clean: Hornhelm to Huldar to Miran and back to Ironband, with Bingles' supplies on the side.
  accept 273 -- Resupplying the Excavation - Jern Hornhelm; supplies for Huldar
step South of the dig - Huldar's supplies
  when onquest 273

  complete 273 @51.2,69.0 era -- find Huldar, Miran and Saean south of the dig

  turnin 273 -- Resupplying the Excavation - the supplies to Huldar
  accept 454 -- After the Ambush - Huldar; speak with Miran
  turnin 454 -- After the Ambush - Huldar's word to Miran
  accept 309 -- Protecting the Shipment - Miran; escort the shipment to the dig
step The excavation escort
  when onquest 309

  complete 309 @65.1,65.8 era -- escort Miran and the shipment to the excavation site

  turnin 309 -- Protecting the Shipment - the shipment to Prospector Ironband
  accept 2038 -- Bingles' Missing Supplies - Bingles Blastenheimer; his wrench, screwdriver, hammer and blastencapper, along the dam road
step The dam road toolbuckets
  when onquest 2038

  complete 2038 @51.8,24.1 era -- Bingles' Wrench, Screwdriver, Hammer and Blastencapper from the toolbuckets

  turnin 2038 -- Bingles' Missing Supplies - the supplies to Bingles Blastenheimer

step Farstrider Lodge - the hunt

  tip Daryl the Youngling (83.5, 65.5), Vyrin Swiftwind (81.7, 64.1) and Marek Ironheart (81.8, 61.7) hold the lodge. The hunts are timed - 257 runs fifteen minutes, 258 twelve - and Ol' Sooty is a level-20 elite: bring help or outlevel him.
  accept 257 -- A Hunter's Boast - Daryl the Youngling; six Mountain Buzzards in fifteen minutes
  complete 257 @68.4,50.5 era -- six Mountain Buzzards
  turnin 257 -- A Hunter's Boast - back to Daryl the Youngling
  accept 258 -- A Hunter's Challenge - Daryl the Youngling; five Elder Mountain Boars in twelve minutes
  complete 258 @60.2,33.9 era -- five Elder Mountain Boars
  turnin 258 -- A Hunter's Challenge - back to Daryl the Youngling
  accept 271 -- Vyrin's Revenge - Vyrin Swiftwind; Ol' Sooty's Head. Sooty (37.9, 63.4) is a level-20 elite - group content.
  complete 271 @37.9,63.4 era -- Ol' Sooty's Head
  turnin 271 -- Vyrin's Revenge - the head to Daryl the Youngling
  accept 531 -- Vyrin's Revenge - Daryl the Youngling; bring the head to Vyrin Swiftwind
  turnin 531 -- Vyrin's Revenge - the head to Vyrin Swiftwind
  accept 385 -- Crocolisk Hunting - Marek Ironheart; meat and skins
  complete 385 @51.2,34.9 era -- five Crocolisk Meat and six Crocolisk Skins off the Loch Crocolisks
  turnin 385 -- Crocolisk Hunting - the meat and skins to Marek Ironheart
  accept 86758 -- Twisting the Knife - Marek Ironheart; Daggerfang and his knife
  complete 86758 @55.5,43.2 era -- Daggerfang and Marek's Croc-Hunting Knife
  turnin 86758 -- Twisting the Knife - the knife to Marek Ironheart

step Mo'grosh stronghold and the Loch shore

  tip The Mo'grosh (63-79, 14-32) are all elites - Ogres, Brutes, Enforcers, Shamans, Mystics and Chok'sul himself. Treat the whole stronghold as group content. The shore below holds crocolisks and Khara's toolbox.
  complete 255 @66.0,21.6 era -- four Mo'grosh Ogres, four Brutes and four Enforcers
  complete 256 @79.6,14.7 era -- Chok'sul's Head
  note Silver of the Waves (86614): work the Discarded Fishing Toolbox on the shore (48-56, 39-54) - the silver clip goes to Khara Deepwater.
  accept 86614 -- Silver of the Waves - the toolbox on the Loch shore
  turnin 86614 -- Silver of the Waves - the Monogrammed Silver Hair clip to Khara Deepwater
  turnin 255 -- Mercenaries - the Mo'grosh dead to Magistrate Bluntnose
  turnin 256 -- WANTED: Chok'sul - Chok'sul's Head to Magistrate Bluntnose

step Mo'grosh reagents - Dark Threat supplies
  when onquest 278

  complete 278 @74.3,34.7 era -- a Mo'grosh Crystal off the ogres
  complete 278 @74.3,34.7 era -- Lurker Venom off the Wood Lurkers, east
  complete 278 @51.2,34.9 era -- a Crocolisk Tear off the Loch Crocolisks

step Algaz and the Wetlands - the exits

  zone map 1437

  tip North through Algaz into the Wetlands: Rockgar (25.4, 10.4) holds the pass; Ashlan Stonesmirk (50.1, 18.2) takes the powder in Dun Modr; traverse Dun Algaz (53.7, 70.3) for Valstag in Menethil; Hervdana (65.8, 76.5) takes the Shaman water line. Take 274 and 94501 while here - both gate Loch turnins.
  accept 455 -- The Algaz Gauntlet - Mountaineer Rockgar. Needs 468 (Kadrell, Dun Morogh) first - Kadrell also stands in Thelsamar, so take it if offered.
  turnin 161 -- A Dark Threat Looms - the powder to Ashlan Stonesmirk
  note A Dark Threat Looms (274): take it from Ashlan and report to Hinderweir - 278 needs it first.
step Dun Algaz traverse
  when onquest 455

  complete 455 @53.7,70.3 era -- traverse Dun Algaz; eight Dragonmaw Scouts and six Dragonmaw Grunts

  turnin 455 -- The Algaz Gauntlet - the gauntlet to Valstag Ironjaw
  turnin 94495 only Shaman -- Call of Water - Norric's word to Hervdana Saegrund
  note Shamans: Hervdana offers Call of Water (94501) back to Norric - 94502 needs it first. Its own pre (94500, Ashenvale waters) is a separate trip; take the warning if it is not done.
  note Call of Water (94501): take it from Hervdana and carry the Vial of Purest Water to Norric Lochthane back in Loch Modan - 94502 needs it first. Not a Loch accept, so it rides as a note, like 274.

step Stonewrought Dam - disarming

  zone map 1432

  tip Back at the dam with the Wetlands errands done: Hinderweir's reagents come together, the keg goes in the water, and the Disarming Mixture ends the chain.
  turnin 278 -- A Dark Threat Looms - the reagents to Chief Engineer Hinderweir
  accept 280 -- A Dark Threat Looms - Chief Engineer Hinderweir; the powder keg at the dam's base
  turnin 280 -- A Dark Threat Looms - stir in the Disarming Mixture, at the keg
  accept 283 -- A Dark Threat Looms - the keg; the mixture worked
  turnin 283 -- A Dark Threat Looms - the news to Chief Engineer Hinderweir

step Stormwind - Stormpike's Order

  zone map 1453

  tip Stormpike's request goes to Furen Longbeard in Stormwind.
  turnin 1338 -- Stormpike's Order - the request to Furen Longbeard

step Stendel's Pond - cleanse the Corruption
  only Shaman
  when onquest 94502

  zone map 1436

  tip Stendel's Pond: drink the Water Sapta, cleanse the Corrupt Manifestation, and leave the bracers at the Forgotten Shrine.
  complete 94502 @45.7,60.1 -- the Corrupt Manifestation of Water at Stendel's Pond
  turnin 94502 @45.6,59.9 era -- the Corrupt Manifestation's Bracers at the Forgotten Shrine

step Thelsamar - muster out
  zone map 1432

  tip Loch Modan done: every census quest accepted and handed in. Thorgrum takes the last list; the Wetlands road runs north from here.
  turnin 6387 only Dwarf,Gnome -- Honor Students - Brock's List to Thorgrum Borrelson
